  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Incorporate conversational and generative AI into business processes",
    "splashDescription": "Google Gemini (formerly known as Bard) combines powerful conversational and generative AI capabilities to enable natural language understanding, context-aware interactions, and content generation. The Google Gemini connector enables seamless interaction between Camunda-powered business processes and Gemini so you can integrate AI into automated processes, enhancing decision-making, user interactions, and overall process efficiency.",
